# OPTIONAL cross-implementation check of S1 only (NOT RUN). ORCA 6.1.1 RI-ADC(2) is closed-shell and, per the
# 6.1.1 manual, has no documented triplet option; this checks E(S1) against PySCF DF-RADC(2), not dEST.
! ADC2 def2-TZVP def2-TZVP/C TightSCF FrozenCore
%maxcore 3000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%mdci
  nroots 4
end
* xyzfile 0 1 ../../xyz/1.xyz
